  "instructions": [
    "Heat the sesame oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the turmeric and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the gochujang and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the vegetable broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Add the rice vermicelli and cook according to the package instructions.",
    "Add the chopped kimchi and cook for another 2 minutes.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped green onions and toasted sesame seeds."
